flowchart TD
    U[User] --> P[Booking Preferences\nbudget, dates, area, constraints]
    P --> BO[Booking Orchestrator Agent]

    BO --> PC[Policy and Risk Checks\nallowed providers, spend cap, PII scope]
    PC --> Q[Search Task Plan]

    Q --> BR[Browser Control Agent\nPlaywright automation]
    BR --> W1[Provider Site A]
    BR --> W2[Provider Site B]
    BR --> W3[Ticketing Site C]

    W1 --> X[Option Extraction\nprice, policy, score, location]
    W2 --> X
    W3 --> X

    X --> N[Normalization + Ranking Engine]
    N --> H[Human Review Card\nranked options + tradeoffs]

    H -->|select option| BO2[Booking Execution Plan]
    H -->|reject all| Q

    BO2 --> CF[Form Fill and Hold\nnever auto-pay without confirmation]
    CF --> FC[Final Confirmation Prompt]
    FC -->|confirm| BK[Complete Booking Action]
    FC -->|cancel| END1((Abort))

    BK --> R[Write Booking Record\ntrip state + audit log]
    R --> END2((Done))
